#   localize_meshgrid.py and src/localization/*.py. Atom roles (one row per AST node; a node with
#   several roles is one row naming them all):
#   
#     test      the test of an if / elif / while / assert / conditional expression
#     operand   an operand of a BoolOp (every BoolOp, recursively)
#     compare   a Compare (membership and registered-constant checks included)
#     not       a ``not`` (UnaryOp Not)
#     comp-if   a comprehension ``if``
#     isinstance an ``isinstance(...)`` call
#     exit      a return / raise / continue / break inside a conditional branch (an if / elif /
#               else body or an except handler, at any depth inside the function)
#     reason    a statement that appends or adds a reason or the state a verdict is computed
#               from: ``x.append / extend / add / update / setdefault / pop / remove(...)``,
#               ``x += ...``, ``_collect(...)``, an assignment whose value holds a reason literal
#     call      any other call statement (an effect or a raising check)
#     schema    a ``field:kind`` registration token of EVIDENCE_SCHEMA (in ``_TOP``, ``_INPUTS``,
